Modified since 2026-10-20. Summary of changes:
  - Removed analytics (Firebase, PostHog, Umeng) and the AD_ID / BILLING permissions.
  - Removed payments (RevenueCat, Paddle, StoreKit); all Pro features unlocked.
  - AI features and transcription call OpenAI (or a compatible endpoint) directly,
    using an API key entered by the user in the app.
  - Guest mode by default; all requests to the original author's backend disabled.
  - Added Vietnamese UI and native-language support.
  - New Android package (app.echoloop.selfhost), app name "Study Loop", own signing key.
The full list of changes is in SELFHOST_TASKS.md and the git history.

